  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">United Nations Capital Development Fund Pacific Programmes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The United Nations Capital Development Fund (UNCDF) Pacific Programme Investment focuses on digital economy development and climate and disaster risk insurance. It consists of two sub-programmes, the Pacific Digital Economies Programme (PDEP) and the Pacific Insurance and Climate Adaptation Programme (PICAP) and builds on the digital financial services and inclusive insurance work that was begun under the Pacific Financial Inclusion Programme. The goal of the UNCDF Pacific Programme is to develop innovative and inclusive regional programmes that allow rural communities, women and MSMEs, as well as labour mobility workers to enhance market participation and effectively better manage risks. This will result in poverty reduction, improved livelihoods and economic growth.</narrative>
  </description>
